note bottom
Real-time collaborative editing state is not a PostgreSQL entity.
Liveblocks stores room state, presence, cursors, CRDT sync, and inline comment threads externally.
Pagemark persists durable collaborative Markdown snapshots in sections.content_md.
end note
@enduml
